    ["\n当季新品“未来梦”，梦中窥见后日谈\n\n招牌特调“火烧玫瑰”，坠入花海温柔乡\n\n更多精品美酒，尊贵人士的首选\n\n邀请您前来品尝！"] = "\nSeasonal new arrival 'Future Dream', glimpse the epilogue in a dream\n\nSignature cocktail 'Burning Rose', fall into the gentle land of a flower sea\n\nMore premium fine wines, the first choice for distinguished people\n\nInviting you to come and taste!",
