    ["　　<Letter_Highlight_HW>梅丽莎</>今天从贝克兰德回来，本来该我去接她的。\n　　但教会临时有点事，辛苦你帮我去黑荆棘接待一下。\n　　你在“愚者”先生的历史里见过她，虽然过了几年，她可能也长高了，但模样应该变化不大。\n　　给你个机会，好好表现！"] = "<Letter_Highlight_HW> Melissa </> is coming back from Backlund today, I was supposed to pick her up. \n But the Church has some urgent matters, so I'd appreciate it if you could help me receive her at Blackthorn. \n You've seen her in Mr. Fool's history; although it's been a few years and she might have grown taller, her appearance shouldn't have changed much. \n Here's your chance, make a good impression!",
    ["　　今天我在那个遗迹里找到一本旧书！\n　　书上提到一种起死回生的魔法，说是要通过仪式向神祈祷，借助丰饶之树的力量什么的。\n　　神指的是女神吗？仪式需要的东西倒是很简单，用平时攒下的零花钱就能买全了！\n　　等着吧，小云，你回来后，我一定给你摘最甜的树莓吃！\n　　这事可不能告诉妈妈，唉，她太爱大惊小怪。\n　　等我把小云带回家，她肯定会吓一大跳吧，嘿嘿。"] = "Today I found an old book in those ruins! \n The book mentions a magic to bring the dead back to life, saying it requires praying to a god through a ritual, using the power of the Tree of Abundance or something. \n Does the god refer to the Goddess? The things needed for the ritual are quite simple; I can buy them all with the pocket money I've saved up! \n Just you wait, Little Cloud, when you come back, I will definitely pick the sweetest raspberries for you to eat! \n I can't tell Mom about this; sigh, she is too prone to making a fuss. \n When I bring Little Cloud home, she will definitely be shocked, hehe.",
    ["《伯爵归来》？"] = "\"The Count Returns\"?",
    ["【副本测试】97级属性-中R"] = "[Dungeon Test] Level 97 Stats - Mid-Spender",
    ["一枚由欲望组成的齿轮，咬合着贪婪与痴迷。欲念使者乐意将它送给任何人——反正它总会回到自己手上，浸满持有者的祈求和渴念。\n赌徒输光最后一苏勒时摸到了它，商人签完最后一纸契约时攥住了它，没人记得是怎么接过来的，就像没人记得自己什么时候开始渴望。\n\"再赌一次！就一次！\"持有者发抖而偏执的声音总是那么悦耳。\n\"好啊。\"他总是这么回答，微笑着，见证一个又一个人匍匐在他面前，亲吻他的掌心。\n持有齿轮的人，总会听到内心渴望的回音，总会与他相遇。"] = "A gear made of desire, interlocking with greed and obsession. The Messenger of Desire is happy to give it to anyone—it always finds its way back to them, soaked in the prayers and cravings of its holder. \n The gambler touched it when he lost his last sou, and the merchant gripped it when he signed his final contract. No one remembers how they received it, just as no one remembers when they began to crave. \n \"One more bet! Just one more!\" The holder's trembling, paranoid voice is always so pleasant. \n \"Very well.\" He always replies, smiling, witnessing one person after another crawl before him, kissing his palm. \n Those who hold the gear will always hear the echo of their inner desires and will always meet him.",
