    ["埃德温有什么事？"] = "What Does Edwin Want?",
    ["夜深了，埃尔西娅轻轻关上办公室的门，门外值夜者小队的成员们正欢快地聊天。她的目光投向那表面仿佛镜子的黑色液体。每次晋升都是一场代价是失控的豪赌，但为了守护市民，她必须变强，拥有战胜危险的力量，现在是抉择的时候了。\n深不见底的安静吞没了她，随之而来的是布满每寸皮肤的爆裂之痛。痛苦的呼喊就在喉咙，可她听不见自己的声音。很快，她感受不到自己的身体了，疼痛消失了，恐惧消失了，所有的一切都消失了。她的意识都无法知晓自己赌输了。她不存在了。\n“队长……咦？”清晨时分，年轻人推开房门，没找到队长，却看到了一枚由发丝缠绕而成的简单饰品。它散发着幽深的静谧，让他想起他的队长。"] = "The night grew deep, and Elsea gently closed the office door. Outside, the members of the Nighthawks squad were chatting happily. Her gaze turned to the black liquid that looked like a mirror. Every advancement is a gamble where the price is loss of control, but to protect the citizens, she had to become stronger and possess the power to overcome danger. Now was the time for a choice. \n A bottomless silence swallowed her, followed by a bursting pain that covered every inch of her skin. A painful cry was in her throat, but she couldn't hear her own voice. Soon, she could no longer feel her body; the pain vanished, the fear vanished, and everything disappeared. Her consciousness couldn't even know that she had lost the gamble. She ceased to exist. \n \"Captain... huh?\" In the early morning, a young man pushed open the door and didn't find the captain, but saw a simple accessory made of braided hair. It radiated a profound tranquility, reminding him of his captain.",
